<title>BRAZIL: Brazil bolsas halt trade in Petrobras.</title>
<headline>Brazil bolsas halt trade in Petrobras.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian stock exchanges said they would halt trade in state oil firm Petrobras Friday.</p>
<p>The suspension follows a request from the company as its shareholders will meet today, a spokeswoman for Sao Paulo bourse said.</p>
<p>On Thursday, Petrobras preferred closed up 4.25 percent at 221 reais on the Sao Paulo bolsa.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
